{
  "name": "Teacher showcase: weather → AI → email, Telegram, Discord",
  "meta": {
    "description": "One click shows most of FlowForge live: real weather, data transformation (Code, IF branches, Merge), a Wait, an AI Agent that writes a briefing, then email + Telegram + Discord at the same time, plus a retry + error output demo. Keys come from Credentials or .env; a missing key never stops the run.",
    "categories": ["AI", "Email", "Messaging", "Data"]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ts-start",
      "name": "Start demo",
      "type": "flowforge.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 300],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-settings",
      "name": "Demo settings",
      "type": "flowforge.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [220, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "s1", "name": "city", "value": "Marrakesh, Morocco", "type": "string" },
            { "id": "s2", "name": "warmFrom", "value": 22, "type": "number" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-weather",
      "name": "Get weather",
      "type": "flowforge.openMeteo",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getWeather",
        "locationMode": "city",
        "city": "={{ $json.city }}",
        "include": ["current", "daily"],
        "forecastDays": 5
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 1000
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-split",
      "name": "One item per day",
      "type": "flowforge.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [660, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// The weather node returns one item with a list of days: turn it into one item per day.\nconst w = $input.first().json;\nconst warmFrom = $('Demo settings').first().json.warmFrom;\nreturn w.daily.map((d) => ({\n  city: w.location.name,\n  date: d.date,\n  emoji: d.emoji,\n  description: d.description,\n  min: d.temperatureMin,\n  max: d.temperatureMax,\n  unit: w.units.temperature,\n  warmFrom,\n}));"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-if",
      "name": "Warm day?",
      "type": "flowforge.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [880, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "conditions": [
            { "id": "c1", "leftValue": "={{ $json.max }}", "rightValue": "={{ $json.warmFrom }}", "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "gte" } }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-warm",
      "name": "Warm: t-shirt",
      "type": "flowforge.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 180],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "assignments": { "assignments": [{ "id": "w1", "name": "advice", "value": "☀️ warm, t-shirt weather", "type": "string" }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-cool",
      "name": "Cool: jacket",
      "type": "flowforge.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1100, 420],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "assignments": { "assignments": [{ "id": "k1", "name": "advice", "value": "🧥 cool, take a jacket", "type": "string" }] }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-merge",
      "name": "Merge branches",
      "type": "flowforge.merge",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1320, 300],
      "parameters": { "mode": "append" }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-wait",
      "name": "Wait 2 seconds",
      "type": "flowforge.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1540, 300],
      "parameters": { "resume": "timeInterval", "amount": 2, "unit": "seconds" }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-report",
      "name": "Build report",
      "type": "flowforge.code",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1760, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Many items in, one summary item out.\nconst days = $input.all().map((i) => i.json).sort((a, b) => a.date.localeCompare(b.date));\nconst lines = days.map((d) => `${d.emoji} ${d.date}: ${d.min} to ${d.max} ${d.unit}, ${d.description} (${d.advice})`);\nreturn [{\n  city: days[0]?.city ?? 'your city',\n  days: days.length,\n  warmDays: days.filter((d) => d.advice.includes('warm')).length,\n  report: lines.join('\\n'),\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-agent",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "flowforge.aiAgent",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1980, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "=Write a friendly weather briefing for students in {{ $json.city }} in at most 3 short sentences, based on this {{ $json.days }}-day forecast:\n{{ $json.report }}",
        "systemMessage": "You are a cheerful assistant for a school demo. Plain text only, no Markdown, no lists. Never invent numbers that are not in the forecast."
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-model",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "flowforge.geminiChatModel",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1980, 540],
      "parameters": { "model": "default" }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-email",
      "name": "Send email",
      "type": "flowforge.sendEmail",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2240, 100],
      "parameters": {
        "toEmail": "={{ $env.CHECK_EMAIL_TO || 'you@example.com' }}",
        "subject": "=🌤️ FlowForge showcase: weather in {{ $('Build report').item.json.city }}",
        "emailFormat": "template",
        "templateTitle": "=Weather in {{ $('Build report').item.json.city }}",
        "templateMessage": "={{ $json.output || 'The AI step was skipped (no Gemini key or no answer), here is the raw forecast.' }}\n\n**Next {{ $('Build report').item.json.days }} days**\n{{ $('Build report').item.json.report }}",
        "templateFooter": "Sent by the FlowForge teacher showcase workflow.",
        "templateColor": "#ff6d5a"
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-telegram",
      "name": "Send Telegram",
      "type": "flowforge.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2240, 300],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "",
        "text": "=🌤️ {{ $('Build report').item.json.city }}\n\n{{ $json.output || $('Build report').item.json.report }}",
        "parseMode": "none"
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-discord",
      "name": "Post to Discord",
      "type": "flowforge.discord",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [2240, 500],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "content": "🌤️ **FlowForge showcase**",
        "embeds": {
          "embed": [
            {
              "title": "=Weather in {{ $('Build report').item.json.city }}",
              "description": "={{ $json.output || 'AI step skipped: raw forecast below.' }}",
              "color": "#ff6d5a",
              "footerText": "FlowForge teacher showcase",
              "timestamp": "now",
              "fieldsJson": "={{ [{ name: 'Forecast', value: $('Build report').item.json.report.slice(0, 1000) }, { name: 'Warm days', value: String($('Build report').item.json.warmDays), inline: true }] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": { "username": "FlowForge" }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-broken",
      "name": "Call a broken API",
      "type": "flowforge.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [440, 640],
      "parameters": { "method": "GET", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:59999/status" },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 300,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-ok",
      "name": "API answered",
      "type": "flowforge.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [700, 560],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-handled",
      "name": "Error handled",
      "type": "flowforge.set",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [700, 720],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            { "id": "h1", "name": "result", "value": "=The API failed 3 times ({{ $json.error }}), but the workflow kept going thanks to the error output.", "type": "string" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ts-note",
      "name": "How to show it",
      "type": "flowforge.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-20, -120],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Teacher showcase\n1. Click **Execute workflow** and watch the nodes light up (particles = items flowing).\n2. **Get weather**: real data, no key. **One item per day** (Code) turns 1 item into 5.\n3. **Warm day?** splits the days, **Merge** joins them, **Wait** pauses 2 s live.\n4. **AI Agent** + Gemini writes the briefing, then **email, Telegram and Discord** go out in parallel.\n5. Bottom branch: an API that is down, **retried 3 times**, then the **error output** handles it.\n6. Open any node: INPUT / OUTPUT. Then **Executions → Time travel** to replay the run.\n\nNo key for a service? That node shows a clear error and the run still finishes.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 300,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Start demo": { "main": [[{ "node": "Demo settings", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Demo settings": {
      "main": [[
        { "node": "Get weather", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Call a broken API", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
      ]]
    },
    "Get weather": { "main": [[{ "node": "One item per day", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "One item per day": { "main": [[{ "node": "Warm day?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Warm day?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Warm: t-shirt", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Cool: jacket", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Warm: t-shirt": { "main": [[{ "node": "Merge branches", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Cool: jacket": { "main": [[{ "node": "Merge branches", "type": "main", "index": 1 }]] },
    "Merge branches": { "main": [[{ "node": "Wait 2 seconds", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Wait 2 seconds": { "main": [[{ "node": "Build report", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Build report": { "main": [[{ "node": "AI Agent", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Gemini Chat Model": { "ai_languageModel": [[{ "node": "AI Agent", "type": "ai_languageModel", "index": 0 }]] },
    "AI Agent": {
      "main": [[
        { "node": "Send email", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Send Telegram", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Post to Discord", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
      ]]
    },
    "Call a broken API": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "API answered", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Error handled", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {}
}
